msgstr "Steam achievements: read directly from this PC's Steam client (account {}), with no key and no setup. A game appears after its first session on this PC."

#: crates/halcyon-app/ui/pages/settings.slint:596
msgid "Succès Steam : aucun compte Steam trouvé sur ce PC. Ouvrez Steam une fois connecté : les succès seront ensuite lus directement, sans clé."
msgstr "Steam achievements: no Steam account found on this PC. Open Steam once while signed in: achievements will then be read directly, with no key."

#: crates/halcyon-app/ui/pages/settings.slint:600
msgid "Visuels : Steam, Epic Games et GOG fournissent jaquettes, bannières et logos sans configuration. Pour les jeux standalone, Halcyon cherche le jeu dans la boutique Steam ; pour les jeux émulés, dans libretro-thumbnails (projet RetroArch)."
msgstr "Artwork: Steam, Epic Games and GOG provide covers, banners and logos with no setup. For standalone games, Halcyon looks the game up in the Steam store; for emulated games, in libretro-thumbnails (RetroArch project)."

#: crates/halcyon-app/ui/pages/settings.slint:603
msgid "Les succès Epic Games ne sont pas disponibles : Epic ne propose pas d'API publique."
msgstr "Epic Games achievements aren't available: Epic offers no public API."

#: crates/halcyon-app/ui/pages/settings.slint:610
