msgstr "Incremental: only games not synced for 12 h, or with new achievements saved by Steam, are read again."

#: crates/halcyon-app/ui/pages/settings.slint:629
msgid "Surveiller les succès pendant une partie"
msgstr "Watch achievements during a game"

#: crates/halcyon-app/ui/pages/settings.slint:630
